DESCRIPTION:Heather Pasternak is a Los Angeles-based comedian\, writer\, an
 d producer known for her sharp\, relatable humor—especially when it comes
  to the chaos and charm of modern motherhood. You've seen her on The Tonigh
 t Show Starring Jimmy Fallon\, The Late Show with Stephen Colbert\, CBS\, N
 etflix\, FOX\, 800 Pound Gorilla\, Don’t Tell Comedy\, Comics Unleashed. 
 Most recently\, she appeared on Netflix's Funny AF with Kevin Hart and has 
 been heard on SiriusXM.\n\nHeather is a content producer for the syndicated
  series\, Funny You Should Ask and recently wrapped a weekly residency at t
 he Jimmy Kimmel Comedy Club in Las Vegas. Pasternak is also the co-founder 
 of The Comedy Partners\, where she leads corporate workshops and teaches st
 and-upcomedy across the country. Whether on stage or in the classroom\, her
  comedy strikes a chord with anyone juggling work\, life\, and parenting—
 with a little sarcasm and a lot of truth. Today\, she can be seen performin
 g around the country\n\nManagement reserves the right to prevent customers 
